# Copy to .env.local for local dev. In production, set these in Vercel's
# project settings (Settings → Environment Variables) and redeploy.

# Read-only GitHub token for looking up the latest release (download links and
# build version). Needed while the repo is private. Once it is public it is
# optional, but recommended: without it, GitHub's limit is 60 requests an hour
# per IP address, and Vercel shares outgoing addresses between projects.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
